OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks cancelled over dry
OL,4,Aweather safety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FDry conditions have led to the
OL,7,Fcancellation of the North Show and
OL,8,FBattle of Flowers fireworks display at
OL,9,FSaumarez Park, organisers have said.
OL,11,FThe Northern Agricultural &
OL,12,FHorticultural Society confirmed the
OL,13,Fannual display would not go ahead this
OL,14,Fyear after taking formal safety advice
OL,15,Fand carrying out a detailed assessment
OL,16,Fwith its fireworks provider, Standard
OL,17,FFireworks.
OL,19,FThe decision comes after an unusually
OL,20,Fdry spell in Guernsey.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
